@startuml state-subrequest
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #1C2230
  FontColor #1C2230
  ArrowColor #1C2230
}
skinparam state<<sub>> {
  BorderColor #E9A23B
}

title SubRequest.status state machine (spec §7)

[*] --> REQUESTED : createSubRequest (UC-04, FR-06)

state REQUESTED <<sub>>
state ACCEPTED <<sub>>
state APPROVED <<sub>>
state REJECTED <<sub>>
state FAILED <<sub>>
state EXPIRED <<sub>>
state CANCELLED <<sub>>

REQUESTED --> ACCEPTED : candidate accepts\n[first acceptance, BR-02] / respondToRequest (UC-05)
REQUESTED --> FAILED : no eligible candidate at creation\nor every target answered can't (BR-13) / createSubRequest, respondToRequest (UC-05)
REQUESTED --> EXPIRED : deadline <= now\nor shift.start <= now (BR-12) / expireOverdue (UC-11)
REQUESTED --> CANCELLED : requester cancels (UC-12, FR-19)

ACCEPTED --> APPROVED : owner approves\n[BR-04: request must be ACCEPTED] / decideRequest (UC-06)
ACCEPTED --> REJECTED : owner rejects / decideRequest (UC-06)
ACCEPTED --> EXPIRED : deadline <= now\nor shift.start <= now (BR-12) / expireOverdue (UC-11)
ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED : requester cancels (UC-12, FR-19)

APPROVED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of APPROVED : final state
note right of REJECTED : final state
note right of FAILED : final state\n(BR-13: REQUEST_FAILED to requester + owner;\nsurfaced as getWorkerHome/getOwnerHome "failed"\nuntil markNotificationsRead(workerId, ids) acks it;\nowner can only acknowledge; accepting or cancelling a\nFAILED request is refused as REQUEST_CLOSED)
note right of EXPIRED : final state\n(A3 System Clock actor)
note right of CANCELLED : final state
@enduml
